  ('abb-5f61b5fa', '2CDS272337R0054', '2CDS272337R0054', 'ABB Miniature Circuit Breaker - SU200M - 2P - C - 5 ampere', 'ABB', 'Switchgear', 'SU202M-C5 Miniature Circuit Breaker C-Char., 10kA, 5A, 2P UL489', 9409, 9221, 'pc', 'https://shop.in.abb.com/media/catalog/product/6/3/63b5ae88723969.00710081.jpg', true, true, 10450),
  ('abb-d880135c', '2CDS200909R0002', '2CDS200909R0002', 'ABB S2C-A2 - Shunt Trip', 'ABB', 'Switchgear', 'Remote opening of the device when a voltage is applied. Suitable for MCBs S200 series and RCBOs DS 200 series.', 1793, 1757, 'pc', 'https://shop.in.abb.com/media/catalog/product/6/3/63b5ae8b0de648.05555143.png', true, true, 10451),
  ('abb-b041c647', '2CDS251001R0044', '2CDS251001R0044', 'ABB Miniature Circuit Breaker - S200 - 1P - C - 4 ampere', 'ABB', 'Switchgear', 'System pro M compact S200 miniature circuit breakers are current limiting. They have two different tripping mechanisms, the delayed thermal tripping mechanism for overload protection and the electromechanic tripping mechanism for short circuit protection. They are available in different characteristics (B,C,D,K,Z), configurations (1P,1P+N,2P,3P,3P+N,4P), breaking capacities (up to 6 kA at 230/400 ', 1253.58, 1229, 'pc', 'https://shop.in.abb.com/media/catalog/product/6/3/63b5ae8dd4c317.11032750.png', true, true, 10452),
  ('abb-249f7fdf', '2CDS200946R0001', '2CDS200946R0001', 'ABB S2C-H6-11R - Auxiliary Contact', 'ABB', 'Switchgear', 'S2C-H6-11R Auxiliary contact with contact configuration 1NO/1NC', 531, 520, 'pc', 'https://shop.in.abb.com/media/catalog/product/6/3/63b5ae9fae8a33.73480916.jpg', true, true, 10453),
  ('abb-c7d6660d', '2CSG152434R1202', '2CSG152434R1202', 'ABB ELR96P - Residual Current Monitor', 'ABB', 'Switchgear', 'The ELR electronic residual current relay allows monitoring and protection of the low voltage distribution network, through the use of a toroidal transformer. Protection is achieved in combination with the MCBs and MCCBs. The ELR front panel residual current relay is compliant with protection standard 60947-2 Annex M in order to offer a cumulative operational time (residual current relay, shunt-tr', 10170, 9967, 'pc', 'https://shop.in.abb.com/media/catalog/product/6/3/63b5aed7353c54.90576801.jpg', true, true, 10454),
  ('abb-4103f461', '2CTB815710R0700', '2CTB815710R0700', 'ABB OVR T1-T2 3N 12.5-275s P TS QS Surge Protective Device', 'ABB', 'Switchgear', 'Surge protective devices SPD type 1- type 2 protect low-voltage consumer systems against lightning currents and surge voltages as they are tested as SPD type 1 and type 2 according to IEC 61643-11. The devices are compatible with the System pro M compact series. The SPD with "TS" are optionally equipped with a auxiliary contact. The variants with "reserve varistor" (s) offer additional protection ', 21617, 21185, 'pc', 'https://shop.in.abb.com/media/catalog/product/6/3/63b5aee9722bf1.51355628.png', true, true, 10455),
  ('abb-1211dc3c', '2CTB815708R4900', '2CTB815708R4900', 'ABB OVR T2 3N 80-440s P QS Surge Protective Device', 'ABB', 'Switchgear', 'Surge protective devices SPD type 2 protect low-voltage consumer systems against surge voltages as they are tested as SPD type 2 according to IEC 61643-11. The devices are compatible with the System pro M compact series. The SPD with "TS" are optionally equipped with a auxiliary contact. The variants with "reserve varistor" (s) offer additional protection for the system, as the SPD is not complete', 13106.16, 12844, 'pc', 'https://shop.in.abb.com/media/catalog/product/6/3/63b5aef8060e25.16409512.png', true, true, 10456),
