  ('abb-6babbea1', '2CTB803973R1500', '2CTB803973R1500', 'ABB OVR T2 3N 40-440 P TS QS Surge Protective Device', 'ABB', 'Switchgear', 'Surge protective devices SPD type 2 protect low-voltage consumer systems against surge voltages as they are tested as SPD type 2 according to IEC 61643-11. The devices are compatible with the System pro M compact series. The SPD with "TS" are optionally equipped with a auxiliary contact.', 14916, 14618, 'pc', 'https://shop.in.abb.com/media/catalog/product/6/3/63b5af05b25441.95997163.png', true, true, 10458),
